          <p>
            For 15 years, Jacob has offered voice-led online sessions to people worldwide, and hosted
            in-person retreats across Europe and South Africa. His approach is deep and healing, yet
            grounded and infused with a touch of humour. Everyone — regardless of their affinity for,
            or fear of, singing — is warmly welcomed and easily drawn into his accessible, inclusive
            style.
          </p>
          <p>
            His work focuses on connecting to your essence and addressing what stands in the way,
            using voice work (Somatic Vocal Healing), chanting, and mantra singing. A gifted pianist,
            Jacob’s music transports participants to new realms — inviting moments of profound
            stillness and rejuvenation.
          </p>
